-- name: test_sync_materialized_view_with_colocate @sequential
-- Test Point: Colocated bitmap, HLL and percentile indexes retain sketch contents across three input batches.
-- Method: Decode each index directly, compare independent cardinality/extrema, and require its query rewrite.

